Third-party code in internal/meshopt

meshopt.go is a Go port of meshopt_decoder_reference.js of meshoptimizer
1.3.0 (https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer; copyright Arseny Kapoulkine;
the reference decoder is by Jasper St. Pierre), the file the npm package
meshoptimizer@1.3.0 ships. It follows that decoder step by step: the vertex
codec (versions 0 and 1), the triangle and index sequence codecs and the
four vertex filters; the port adds bounds checks.

